{
  "name": "report_check",
  "_comment": "通用汇报格式检查：确定性指标 + 结构/证据/表达三路并行评审 + 汇总判定。seed 传报告正文。",
  "seed_tag": "report",
  "seed_content": "",
  "result_tag": "verdict",
  "pi": {
    "provider": "laptop",
    "model": "deepseek-flash",
    "tools": false,
    "timeout": 180,
    "retries": 2
  },
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "metrics",
      "kind": "command",
      "layer": 0,
      "input_tags": [
        "report"
      ],
      "output_tags": [
        "metrics"
      ],
      "command": "python3 check_report.py",
      "stdin": true,
      "timeout": 60
    },
    {
      "id": "structure",
      "layer": 0,
      "input_tags": [
        "report"
      ],
      "output_tags": [
        "structure"
      ],
      "prompt": "你是汇报结构评审。按清单检查：1) 结论是否在首屏、是否先行；2) 是否有背景/目标；3) 是否说清做法/交付；4) 是否有可核对的证据；5) 是否写风险/限制；6) 是否有下一步。评分 0-10，严格。字段：score、issues、suggestions、missing_sections。\n\n只输出 JSON，不要 Markdown 代码块。\n\n汇报正文：\n{contents}",
      "expect": {
        "type": "json",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "score": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 10
            },
            "issues": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "suggestions": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "missing_sections": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "score",
            "issues",
            "suggestions"
          ]
        }
      },
      "repair": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "evidence",
      "layer": 0,
      "input_tags": [
        "report"
      ],
      "output_tags": [
        "evidence"
      ],
      "prompt": "你是证据标注评审，只检查格式，不评判实验设计。检查：每个关键数字是否标注了基线、时间、样本量（单次也可，写“单次”即可）、来源/命令；是否区分“已验证”与“未验证/推测”；是否把单次结果说成稳定结论。不要要求重复实验、不要要求 P95，也不要因为样本少而扣分——样本少但标注清楚就算合格。评分 0-10，严格。\n只输出 JSON，不要 Markdown 代码块。字段：score、issues、suggestions。\n\n汇报正文：\n{contents}",
      "expect": {
        "type": "json",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "score": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 10
            },
            "issues": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "suggestions": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "missing_sections": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "score",
            "issues",
            "suggestions"
          ]
        }
      },
      "repair": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "clarity",
      "layer": 0,
      "input_tags": [
        "report"
      ],
      "output_tags": [
        "clarity"
      ],
      "prompt": "你是表达评审。检查：术语是否解释；句子是否过长；是否有模糊词（大概/可能/比较好）；结论是否一眼可见；是否堆功能而不是回答问题。评分 0-10，严格。字段：score、issues、suggestions。\n\n只输出 JSON，不要 Markdown 代码块。\n\n汇报正文：\n{contents}",
      "expect": {
        "type": "json",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "score": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 10
            },
            "issues": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "suggestions": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "missing_sections": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "score",
            "issues",
            "suggestions"
          ]
        }
      },
      "repair": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "verdict",
      "layer": 1,
      "input_tags": [
        "report",
        "metrics",
        "structure",
        "evidence",
        "clarity"
      ],
      "output_tags": [
        "verdict"
      ],
      "prompt": "你是汇报终审。综合确定性指标和三位评审，输出最终结论。\n规则：score 取四路加权平均（指标 25%、结构 30%、证据 20%、表达 25%），保留一位小数；pass=true 当且仅当 score>=6.5 且结论/证据/下一步都不缺失。\nissues 合并去重，按严重度排序；suggestions 最多 5 条，必须可执行；summary 一句话（<=80 字）。\n字段：pass、score、issues、suggestions、missing_sections、summary。\n\n[确定性指标]\n{tag:metrics}\n\n[结构评审]\n{tag:structure}\n\n[证据评审]\n{tag:evidence}\n\n[表达评审]\n{tag:clarity}",
      "expect": {
        "type": "json",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "pass": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "score": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 10
            },
            "issues": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "suggestions": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "missing_sections": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "summary": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "pass",
            "score",
            "issues",
            "suggestions"
          ]
        }
      },
      "repair": 1
    }
  ]
}